[chapter id="ch02-wataame" title="Chapter 2 - Lake Morning (cotton candy)"]
[bg file="bg/lake.png"]
[ch file="ch/jolly.png" pos="left"]
[text]Next morning, mountain lake. Mist on the water, village church across the shore. Run run-2026-10-08T20-36-07-756Z-wataame.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]The cotton candy melted a little overnight... now it is a tiny pink cloud hat. I regret nothing.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Yesterday I chose the cotton candy at the matsuri. Today the lake is sparkling like it is showing off.[/text]
[bg file="bg/lake.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Should I skip a stone across the lake, or sit on the dock and watch the mist lift?[/text]
[choose id="lake-choice"]
[option id="skip" label="Skip a flat stone across the lake"]Skip a stone.[/option]
[option id="sit" label="Sit and watch the mist lift"]Sit and watch.[/option]
[/choose]
[label id="after-skip"]
[bg file="bg/lake.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]One... two... three... four skips! The orb counted. The orb is a very serious judge.[/text]
[text]Ripples cross the whole lake, turning the morning sun into a thousand tiny festivals.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Yesterday: festival lights. Today: lake lights. I am collecting kinds of sparkle.[/text]
[goto gen-end]
[label id="after-sit"]
[bg file="bg/lake.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]If I sit very still, the mist sits with me. Today we are both clouds.[/text]
[text]Slowly the mist lifts. The village across the lake appears house by house, like a story being told in order.[/text]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Being a cloud was nice. Being Jolly is also nice. I can be both before breakfast.[/text]
[label id="gen-end"]
[bg file="bg/ramen.png"]
[text speaker="Jolly"]Chapter 2 complete - cotton-candy branch. All that sparkling worked up an appetite... ramen next? (The End - try the other Chapter 1 choice!)[/text]
[end]
